{"type":"message","id":"e5b31f1f","parentId":"8ecaef31","timestamp":"2026-05-29T03:04:31.316Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to separate the document/PPT writing agent from the coding agent in pi. They want to know if this is possible and how to do it. Looking at pi's documentation, pi is primarily a coding agent but can be adapted. The key question is how to separate workflows.\n\nOptions to consider:\n1. Separate sessions with different contexts/system prompts\n2. Different working directories with different AGENTS.md files\n3. Different settings configurations\n4. Using the `--system-prompt` flag to load different instructions\n5. Creating separate pi instances or using tmux\n6. Using different model selections\n\nThe most practical approaches for separation would be:\n1. Different directories with different AGENTS.md and .pi/ configs\n2. Using `--system-prompt` to override the default coding-focused system prompt\n3. Creating a separate \"workspace\" with its own settings\n\nLet me provide a comprehensive answer about how to separate them in pi.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"**可以，pi 支持多种分离方式：**\n\n---\n\n### 方式一：不同目录 + 不同 AGENTS.md（最简单）\n\n```bash\n# 写代码用原目录\ncd ~/workspace/company/adp && pi\n\n# 写文档用另一个目录\nmkdir ~/docs-workspace && cd ~/docs-workspace\n```\n\n在 `~/docs-workspace/AGENTS.md` 中写明：\n\n```markdown\n# 文档写作 Agent\n你是一个专业的文档/PPT写作助手。\n能力：技术方案、PRD、产品文档、PPT 大纲。\n输出格式：Markdown / Marp PPTX。\n不涉及代码编写。\n```\n\n---\n\n### 方式二：不同 session 文件\n\n```bash\n# 代码 session\npi --session ~/code-sessions.jsonl\n\n# 文档 session\npi --session ~/doc-sessions.jsonl\n```\n\n---\n\n### 方式三：自定义 System Prompt（完全隔离）\n\n```bash\npi --system-prompt \"你是一个文档写作助手...\" @docs-workspace\n```\n\n或用项目配置：\n\n```bash\n# 在文档目录创建 .pi/settings.json\n{\n  \"systemPrompt\": \"你是一个文档/PPT写作助手...\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 方式四：不同终端窗口（并行使用）\n\n```bash\n# 终端 1 - 写代码\ncd ~/workspace/adp && pi\n\n# 终端 2 - 写文档\ncd ~/docs && pi --system-prompt \"你是文档助手...\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### 推荐方案：专用文档目录\n\n```bash\nmkdir ~/docs-workspace\ncd ~/docs-workspace\n\n# 创建 AGENTS.md\ncat > AGENTS.md << 'EOF'\n# 文档写作 Agent\n专注于：技术方案、PRD、PPT大纲、产品文档\n工具：Markdown 编写、marp-cli 转 PPTX、模板管理\n不处理：代码编写、调试、重构\nEOF\n\npi\n```\n\n这样每次进入这个目录启动 pi，就会自动加载文档助手的指令，和代码 agent 完全分离。\n\n**你想现在帮你创建这个文档 workspace 吗？**"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"idealab","model":"Qwen3.6-Plus-DogFooding","usage":{"input":58368,"output":855,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59223,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780023857790,"responseId":"msg-3f7decef-3e92-9973-b0af-c36060aa7266"}}
