t see any comments in the example JSON. And the documentation says \"Pi uses JSON settings files\". If pi supported JSONC comments, it would likely show examples with comments.\n\nLet me give a concise answer about both scenarios.\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"pi 使用 **标准 JSON** 格式配置文件，**不支持注释**。\n\n| 文件 | 格式 | 注释符号 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| `settings.json` | JSON | ❌ 不支持注释 |\n| `keybindings.json` | JSON | ❌ 不支持注释 |\n| `models.json` | JSON | ❌ 不支持注释 |\n| **AGENTS.md** | Markdown | ✅ `<!-- 注释内容 -->` |\n\n如果你是想在 **AGENTS.md** 里加注释，用 HTML 注释：\n\n```markdown\n<!-- 这是给 pi 看的注释，不会显示在对话中 -->\n\n# 项目规则\n...\n```\n\n项目中的 `AGENTS.md` 已经在使用这种方式：\n\n```markdown\n<!-- gitnexus:start -->\n...\n<!-- gitnexus:end -->\n```"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"idealab","model":"Qwen3.6-Plus-DogFooding","usage":{"input":63235,"output":1088,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64323,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780024587350,"responseId":"msg-d746082e-d32f-9791-a0b7-cabd851fb2e1"}}
